---
import Main from '../layouts/Main.astro';

---
<!-- Michael DeVito II -->
<Main title="Certifications">
	<div class="certs-content">
		<h1>Certifications</h1>
		<p>Below is a list of all cybersecurity-related certifications I have achieved, including ones that I am currently studying for.</p>
		<br>
	</div>

	<div class="certs-content">

		<section class="cert-entry">
			<img class="cert-image" src="/images/certs/pentestplus.png" alt="CompTIA Pentest+ Badge" />
			<h3>CompTIA Pentest+</h3>
			<p class="info"><span class="status status--progress"><span aria-hidden="true"></span>In progress</span>Exam November 2026</p>
			<p>I am currently studying for the Pentest+ exam as part of the Ethical Hacking course at Messiah University. I am using the Sybex test prep book, as well as online videos and articles to study. I plan on doing interactive labs in preparation for my exam, which is scheduled in November.</p>
		</section>

		<section class="cert-entry">
			<img class="cert-image" src="/images/certs/securityplus.png" alt="CompTIA Security+ Badge" />
			<h3>CompTIA Security+</h3>
			<p class="info"><span class="status status--complete"><span aria-hidden="true"></span>Completed</span>Earned April 2026</p>
			<p>I earned the Security+ cert while taking the Network Security course at Messiah University. I studied using the Sybex test prep book, as well as online videos and practice tests from Dion Training. I studied throughout the Spring 2026 semester and passed the exam in April 2026.</p>
		</section>

		<section class="cert-entry">
			<img class="cert-image" src="/images/certs/networkplus.png" alt="CompTIA Network+ Badge" />
			<h3>CompTIA Network+</h3>
			<p class="info"><span class="status status--complete"><span aria-hidden="true"></span>Completed</span>Earned December 2025</p>
			<p>I earned the Network+ cert while taking the Data Communications & Networking course at Messiah University. I studied using the Sybex test prep book, as well as online videos from Professor Messer and practice tests from Dion Training. I studied for this exam in the same semester as the Linux+ exam, and passed both within one week of each other in December 2025.</p>
		</section>

		<section class="cert-entry">
			<img class="cert-image" src="/images/certs/linuxplus.png" alt="CompTIA Linux+ Badge" />
			<h3>CompTIA Linux+</h3>
			<p class="info"><span class="status status--complete"><span aria-hidden="true"></span>Completed</span>Earned December 2025</p>
			<p>I earned the Linux+ cert while taking the NIX System Administration & Security course at Messiah University. I studied using the Sybex test prep book, as well as online videos and practice tests from Dion Training. I studied for this exam in the same semester as the Network+ exam, and passed both within one week of each other in December 2025.</p>
		</section>

	</div>

</Main>

<style>
	.cert-entry {
		display: flow-root;
		padding: 1.5rem 0;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.25);
	}

	.cert-entry:first-child {
		padding-top: 0;
	}

	.cert-entry:last-child {
		border-bottom: 0;
	}

	.info {
		margin: -0.25rem 0 0.75rem;
		color: #94a3b8;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		font-style: italic;
	}

	.status {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.35rem;
		margin-right: 0.45rem;
		padding: 0.2rem 0.45rem;
		border: 1px solid currentColor;
		font-size: 0.65rem;
		font-weight: 100;
		line-height: 1;
		vertical-align: middle;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.04em;
		font-style: normal;
	}

	.status > span {
		width: 0.4rem;
		height: 0.4rem;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: currentColor;
	}

	.status--complete {
		color: #86efac;
	}

	.status--progress {
		color: #fbbf24;
	}

	.cert-image {
		float: right;
		width: auto;
		height: auto;
		margin: 0 0 1.5rem 2rem;
	}

	@media (max-width: 700px) {
		.cert-image {
			float: none;
			display: block;
			width: 100%;
			max-width: 100%;
			margin: 0 0 1rem;
		}
	}
</style>
